  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tom Dooley**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Alabama Jubilee**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Stone Walls And Steel Bars**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Running The Routs**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Runnig**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Open Up Them Pearly Gates**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Ashland Breakdown**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **All The Luck In The World**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystringsdd2023-08-26** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 143 min [1]\n- **billydd2023-08-26**: source not stated; 27 songs; 143 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystringsdd2023-08-26**: taped by David Dyche; transferred by David Dyche; source: Neumann 140’s > V-3 > Sound Devices 744 24/96 [1]. Also: Transfer chain ran through Logic Pro and Sound Studio, ending in xACT for the final encoding [1]\n- **billydd2023-08-26**: taped by David Dyche; transferred by David Dyche; source: Neumann 150’s > Nick Active Cables > Naiant PFA’s > Sound Devices 744 24/96 [2]. Also: Post-production chain went through Logic Pro, then Sound Studio, then xACT [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-08-26 Orion Amp Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-08-26-orion-amp-regular/) [4]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Orion Amphitheater - Huntsville, AL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/the-orion-amphitheater-huntsville-al/) [5]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Huntsville Orion Amphitheater August 26 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-huntsville-orion-amphitheater-august-26-2023-poster) [6]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-08-25 Orion Amp Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-08-25-orion-amp-regular/) [7]",
